  {
   "id": "like-a-dragon-pirate-yakuza-in-hawaii-317317@1.11",
   "gameId": "like-a-dragon-pirate-yakuza-in-hawaii-317317",
   "displayName": "PATCH 1.11",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-28T01:18:28.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We would like to inform you of the fixes included in patch 1.11 that was released today, as well as the status of our investigation of the issues that have been reported by customers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch 1.11 Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where DLSS and DLSS frame generation would not work properly in some environments. (DLSS OTA Update disabled)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Random Crashes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The development team is currently investigating the following environments in which random crashes occur on the PC version, which have been reported by multiple users.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Windows 11 24H2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Core i9-14900",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "NVIDIA Geforce RTX 3060 GeForce Game Ready Driver 572.47/572.16/566.36",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "3840x2160/120Hz VSync disabled / FPS unlimited",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the environments above, we have confirmed that the crash will not occur by reverting the driver version to 552.44, and we are continuing to investigate this issue and other environments in consultation with the GPU vendor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Driver version that has been confirmed to resolve the issue: GeForce Game Ready Driver 552.44",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We are also investigating other environments and fixing more issues, and plan to release another patch soon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your ongoing support for the Like a Dragon & Yakuza series.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Feb 28 Update on Verification Status",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Additional driver versions confirmed that the crash will not occur in:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "555.85/561.09",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Driver versions where crashes have been confirmed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "556.90/572.60",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Currently, the latest WHQL driver confirmed to have no issues is 561.09. Since the crashes are occurring at the driver level, we are continuing to verify details with the GPU vendor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
